<p><strong data-start="0" data-end="86">Rod-Style Bubble Wall &#8220;Swirley&#8221; at Wild Horse Resort and Casino, Pendleton, Oregon</strong></p>
<p data-start="0" data-end="408">The Rod-Style Bubble Wall &#8220;Swirley&#8221; at Wild Horse Resort and Casino in Pendleton, Oregon, is a breathtaking water feature crafted by Midwest-Tropical. With its captivating bubble movement and unique swirling pattern, this custom installation adds a modern and dynamic focal point to the resort’s luxurious atmosphere.</p>
<h3 data-start="415" data-end="438"><strong data-start="419" data-end="436">Key Features:</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="440" data-end="964">
<li data-start="440" data-end="589"><strong data-start="442" data-end="473">Eye-Catching Swirley Design</strong> &#8211; The swirling bubble pattern creates a mesmerizing visual effect, perfect for high-traffic entertainment spaces.</li>
<li data-start="590" data-end="715"><strong data-start="592" data-end="626">Premium Rod-Style Construction</strong> &#8211; Made with durable acrylic and stainless steel rods, ensuring longevity and elegance.</li>
<li data-start="716" data-end="843"><strong data-start="718" data-end="745">Dynamic Bubble Movement</strong> &#8211; Constant bubble flow generates visual intrigue and enhances the ambiance with calming motion.</li>
<li data-start="844" data-end="964"><strong data-start="846" data-end="873">Customizable Aesthetics</strong> &#8211; Options for frame finishes, lighting effects, and bubble patterns to match your decor.</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="971" data-end="1003"><strong data-start="975" data-end="1001">Customization Options:</strong></h3>
