<li data-start="1276" data-end="1356">Optional colored finishes or metallic accents to match your interior design.</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start="1358" data-end="1394"><strong data-start="1363" data-end="1392">3. Lighting Enhancements:</strong></h4>
<ul data-start="1395" data-end="1554">
<li data-start="1395" data-end="1464">LED lighting integrated into the frame for stunning illumination.</li>
<li data-start="1465" data-end="1554">Choose between static colors or dynamic lighting effects for an immersive experience.</li>
